  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3e3d5def-8ca8-482c-ad07-f352767a1972.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"555\" height=\"289\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6948a559-076f-467e-b62a-ef629d79df8b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"429\" height=\"177\"></a><br><br>Project:Poppa（測試版）</strong></p>\n<p>此模組將來自遊戲&nbsp;<em>Poppy Playtime</em>&nbsp;的經典內容加入 Minecraft，包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>新物品：</strong>&nbsp;抓握背包（GrabPack）、電線工具、掃描儀等。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>獨特機制：</strong>&nbsp;使用電線連接裝置、設定依賴關係並解開謎題。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>氛圍營造：</strong>&nbsp;以工廠為主題的方塊與裝飾品。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d17f2fa0-91a5-4251-810f-522afada9f3b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"246\"></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>運作方式：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>使用&nbsp;<em>電線道具</em>&nbsp;連接電源 &rarr; 電桿 &rarr; 接收器 &rarr; 門。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>依賴模式</strong> - 必須有多個掃描儀處於啟動狀態，門才會開啟。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>駭客模式</strong> - 遠端切換裝置的開關。<br><br></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em><br>可自由用於任何模組包中。請勿反編譯、修改或重新上傳此模組。需註明出處並附上 CurseForge 連結。允許進行直播。<br></em></p>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong>&nbsp;此模組為同人創作，與 Mob Entertainment 無關。<br><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yellowforgestudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_10361272-0c3b-4896-8a2e-81f123f01bd0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"104\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kXsS4ynaG7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_72a5994e-f67d-413c-b9e9-69b31c218a30.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"105\"></a></p>",
